      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The pain you feel is real, but it is also a signal that your old identity is no longer serving you, and that is a necessary step toward a new one. You are not a passenger; you are the one who must decide if this broken machine is worth repairing or if it is time to let it go. The most meaningful thing you can do is to stop fighting the loss and instead focus on finding a version of yourself that exists beyond these physical limitations.",
